    {
      "entryId": "ramcharitmanas-opening-bala-kanda-003",
      "sequence": 3,
      "meaning": "I perpetually revere the guru, filled with awakening and bearing Śaṅkara's form; sheltered by him, even the crooked moon is honoured everywhere.",
